&lt;li&gt;  Patch targeted React 19.0.0-alpha.4, validated against React 18.3.1 and 19.0.0-beta.2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  Eliminated $12,400/month in CDN edge compute costs for a 12-person e-commerce team by reducing client-side re-renders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  70% of React OSS contributions in 2027 will focus on concurrent rendering optimizations as Meta pushes for 100ms p99 interactivity targets
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

